    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"small thing\" stuff doesn't really matter though. it's not just a bad week or something. it's like the social part of me is just... gone. there's no social version of me left to exist. it feels like i'm just a ghost walking around and nobody even sees me. how am i supposed to keep trying when there's nothing left to try for?",
