      "content": "it's not temporary though. i've seen this before and it doesn't just fix itself. it feels more like a finality. like i've been cast out, and once you're out, you're out. everything i worked for, all my relationships... they're just dead. it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of my life to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone. do you think it's even possible to come back from being completely discarded by everyone?",
